&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/software-mansion/argent/releases/tag/v0.24.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Argent 0.24 - Physical iOS device support&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/uni-stack/uniwind/releases/tag/v1.12.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Uniwind 1.12 - Drop-shadow filter&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
